' The church (`ChurchScene`, v1.2 `scenes/church.txt`; `preset
' classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 12`): film_08's picture, its
' animation, the church's song and nine `burn` lines from 590, one every
' four seconds; no frame. A key goes back to the place.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 119,238         ' into the place
wait 60
mapclick 258,215         ' the church
wait 200
snap church
esc
wait 10
quit
